				<r3d:description language="eng">Australian Ocean Data Network (AODN) provides data collected by the Australian marine community. AODN&#039;s data is searchable via map interface and metadata catalogue. AODN is Australia&#039;s exhaustive repository for marine and climate data. AODN has merged with  IMOS eMarine Information Infrastructure (eMII) Facility in May 2016. IMOS is a multi-institutional collaboration with a focus on open data access.  It is ideally placed to manage the AODN on behalf of the Australian marine and climate community.</r3d:description>
